{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai","id":63320,"title":"Dragon-Blooded and Elemental Shintai","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-01T23:17:59-08:00","id":63320,"title":"Dragon-Blooded and Elemental Shintai","content":"As I understand it, the plan for 3e is to let give Infernals a build-your-own shintai that lets them reflect their personal Infernalness.<br /> <br /> Will Dragon-Blooded PCs have something akin to this? Instead of buying charms or elemental martial art techniques, could they have a sort of build-your-own elemental form?<br /> <br /> For example, my fire aspect DB could transform into a higher form with obsidian like skin, a corona of heat, the speed of a flickering flame, and a voice that melts brass. A water aspect DB could create a forum where they can flow between the cracks in wall, drown people within themselves, and no longer needs to breath air.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T00:19:08-08:00","id":63330,"title":"","content":"This would probably be a good way for a DM who wishes to create 'greater' DBs who have some special oomph to them to simulate their increased power, but I sincerely doubt that dragonblooded will gain such a power.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/673-requiem_jeer","name":"Requiem_Jeer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar673_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"105"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T00:49:22-08:00","id":63338,"title":"","content":"I think what you're looking for is an exigent of some element. DBs don't really do the kind of think you're talking about. They're more about viewing elements through the lens of abilities and then through another lens of martial application. Hense charms in the presence tree that are used to scream somebody's head off in combat.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T02:32:22-08:00","id":63354,"title":"","content":"Definitely not in the cards.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":9}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/84-holden","name":"Holden","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar84_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"673"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T03:18:16-08:00","id":63362,"title":"","content":"+1 for a cool idea though. I generally like the &quot;this isn't even my final form&quot;-troupe <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/327-drecain","name":"Drecain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar327_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"216"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T03:42:58-08:00","id":63369,"title":"","content":"I like it as a thing raksha could do.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T06:32:21-08:00","id":63409,"title":"","content":"Even if it's not natively supported, I think there's room for it. DBs have this interesting but rarely seen theme of... I don't know what to call it, maybe &quot;evolvable&quot;? I'm thinking of things like the Numina of the Mist, and to a lesser extent Dragons of a Different Color and Immaculate Grand Masters.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/456-blackwell","name":"Blackwell","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar456_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"977"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T08:07:25-08:00","id":63434,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blackwell</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai?p=63409#post63409\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm thinking of things like the Numina of the Mist</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't think the Numina of the Mist have anything to them that doesn't derive from the Sea of Mind, and I think the fact that they're Dragon Blooded is just an incidental derived from somebody giving Jenna Moran a writing assignment for Dragon Blooded.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blackwell</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Immaculate Grand Masters.</div> </div> </div> </div>How so?<br /> <br /> I feel that, if there's a theme of evolution, it's rarely seen because it's unsuitable and needs to be shoehorned in and kind of harms the credibility of the Dragon Blooded by associating them with some nebulous undefined transcendent form they could have which people fixate on to the exclusion of the actual aristocratic elemental warrior clan that we're given.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T08:11:02-08:00","id":63437,"title":"","content":"Why would Dragon-Blooded transform into something they already are?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T08:45:45-08:00","id":63454,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai?p=63437#post63437\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why would Dragon-Blooded transform into something they already are?</div> </div> </div> </div>Why would Goku go Super Saiyan when he's already Saiyan?<br /> <br /> Why would Squirtle transform into Blastoise when he's already a water pokimon?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Come and rock me Amadeus.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/296-hippokrene","name":"hippokrene","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar296_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2399"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T09:03:35-08:00","id":63459,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai?p=63454#post63454\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why would Goku go Super Saiyan when he's already Saiyan?</div> </div> </div> </div>Dragon-Blooded are always Super Saiyan. <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai?p=63454#post63454\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why would Squirtle transform into Blastoise when he's already a water pokimon?</div> </div> </div> </div>Dragon-Blooded do that by cultivating their Essence and developing their charms. Case in point: <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai#post63320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">For example, my fire aspect DB could transform into a higher form with obsidian like skin,</div> </div> </div> </div>Resistance charm.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai#post63320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">a corona of heat,</div> </div> </div> </div>Anima.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai#post63320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">the speed of a flickering flame,</div> </div> </div> </div>Athletics charm.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai#post63320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">and a voice that melts brass.</div> </div> </div> </div>Presence charm.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai#post63320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">A water aspect DB could create a forum where they can flow between the cracks in wall,</div> </div> </div> </div>Larceny or Athletics charm.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai#post63320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">drown people within themselves,</div> </div> </div> </div>Martial Arts charm.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai#post63320\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">and no longer needs to breath air.</div> </div> </div> </div>Resistance or Survival charm.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":10}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T09:40:05-08:00","id":63469,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hippokrene</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai?p=63454#post63454\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Why would Goku go Super Saiyan when he's already Saiyan?</div> </div> </div> </div>Gotta do something to maintain your rate of escalation after more than 300 chapters.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>hiipokrene</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Why would Squirtle transform into Blastoise when he's already a water pokimon?</div> </div> </div> </div>That's really more like Aspect markings becoming more prominent as your Essence grows.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"color:#00ffff\">I have approximate knowledge of many things.</span><br /> <a href=\"https://forum.rpg.net/index.php?threads/wip-xenoblade-chronicles-the-sword-can-see-the-future.835575/\" target=\"_blank\">Write up as I play Xenoblade Chronicles.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/158-isator-levi","name":"Isator Levi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar158_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17901"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T09:56:07-08:00","id":63474,"title":"","content":"I feel like a teamwork-based Shintai might be able to work, with several dragon-blooded combining as one, Unity of the Closed Fist style.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2034-jaytee","name":"JayTee","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2034_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1805"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T10:58:52-08:00","id":63499,"title":"","content":"Solar: Yeah, that's cool. I also have a power that transforms me into the ultimate embodiment of perfection.<br /> Infernal: You do?<br /> Solar: Yeah. Here, wait, I'll activate it. There, done.<br /> (Long pause as nothing happens.)<br /> Infernal: But you... <i>oooooooh</i>.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":18}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/517-aquillion","name":"Aquillion","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar517_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1341"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T11:18:35-08:00","id":63510,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Blackwell</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai?p=63409#post63409\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Even if it's not natively supported, I think there's room for it. DBs have this interesting but rarely seen theme of... I don't know what to call it, maybe &quot;evolvable&quot;? I'm thinking of things like the Numina of the Mist, and to a lesser extent Dragons of a Different Color and Immaculate Grand Masters.</div> </div> </div> </div>Also Lintha Ng Hut Dukantha and the seemingly really-popular-with-fans Saibok Gauto. There might be some more.<br /> <br /> Dragonbloods seem like they have tended to get the broadest number of mentions of opportunity to transcend their nature. Transcending (and changing) paths are present in the splats who tend to be more denied the opportunity to make their own destiny on their merits (or lack thereof), or have limits to their destiny. (There's a dash of this in Sidereal Martial Arts as well, Infernals and Abyssals have sort of variants).<br /> <br /> That's fine. Still I think a lot of that appeal for Dragonblooded will be less with Exigents around and so more scope for Celestial level power while playing to other themes (even if this a narrow slice of what Exigents are for), which the Devil Tigers made apparent was massively popular. <br /> <br /> And with less of a build up of the Solar-Other gap, and less a gonzo high power focus, it probably will feel less like there idea that being a super-Dragonblooded is necessary to matter as an individual.<br /> <br /> Also, on Exigents again, in a world where a lot more is possible as far as being an Exalt (there's all these weird guys around!), a Dragonblooded transcending its nature becomes less unusual, less threatening to the grand hierarchy of being (with Solars at its head, descending downwards through clear tiers) and so in a way (oddly?) less compelling to fans.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai?p=63338#post63338\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I think what you're looking for is an exigent of some element. DBs don't really do the kind of think you're talking about. They're more about viewing elements through the lens of abilities and then through another lens of martial application. Hense charms in the presence tree that are used to scream somebody's head off in combat.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, with the Dragonblooded, the main restraining factor for me with elemental evolution, aside from power level and all that, is that you want the Dragonblooded Host to feel like these fairly bloodied Spartan, samurai guys who train relentlessly hard at the skills of war, intrigue and empire, and to have that come through in their magic (yes, balanced with a dash of &quot;unfairly advantaged beyond mortals&quot;).<br /> <br /> Not so much these a magocracy whose power more springs forth from meditating upon and channeling the elements. Of course channeling the elements is important to them, but they're really not a magocracy of element-benders.<br /> <br /> So they feel like their magic needs a &quot;harder&quot;(?) rooting in skill than the Infernals...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/929-ghosthead","name":"Ghosthead","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T11:22:21-08:00","id":63511,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai?p=63459#post63459\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Dragon-Blooded are always Super Saiyan.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Dragon-Blooded do that by cultivating their Essence and developing their charms. Case in point:<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Resistance charm.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Anima.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Athletics charm.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Presence charm.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Larceny or Athletics charm.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Martial Arts charm.<br /> <br /> <br /> <br /> Resistance or Survival charm.</div> </div> </div> </div>While I don't disagree with your overall point it probably isn't a good idea for DBs, this same logic could be used to say Infernals don't need Shintai either.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/726-amine-hsu","name":"Amine Hsu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar726_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T11:47:45-08:00","id":63525,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amine Hsu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai?p=63511#post63511\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">While I don't disagree with your overall point it probably isn't a good idea for DBs, this same logic could be used to say Infernals don't need Shintai either.</div> </div> </div> </div>This is true in Ex2, where all Infernal charms serve to transform Infernals into Yozis and shintai are just major steps in the process. <br /> <br /> The Ex3 Infernal preview makes it clear that shintai are generally temporary, that they're not 100% compatible with Infernal charms and that they unlock special charms. Presumably, the shintai take over the job of transforming Infernals into cosmic titans without all the baggage of Ex2. Shintai seem to open up new abilities that are not part of Infernal Exaltation by default, in a manner vaguely similar to Lunar shapeshifting.<br /> <br /> Elemental dragon-bodies, however, are the default state of the Dragon-Blooded. The Dragon-Blooded cannot transform into an elemental form because they were <i>born</i> with an elemental body and they spend their lives developing it through their charms and Essence (or rather, they learn charms and increase their Essence by developing their elemental bodies). <br /> <br /> If there is such a thing as an elemental shintai, it's Terrestrial Exaltation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T12:11:57-08:00","id":63534,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Tiresias</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai?p=63525#post63525\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> This is true in Ex2, where all Infernal charms serve to transform Infernals into Yozis and shintai are just major steps in the process.<br /> <br /> The Ex3 Infernal preview makes it clear that shintai are generally temporary, that they're not 100% compatible with Infernal charms and that they unlock special charms. Presumably, the shintai take over the job of transforming Infernals into cosmic titans without all the baggage of Ex2. Shintai seem to open up new abilities that are not part of Infernal Exaltation by default, in a manner vaguely similar to Lunar shapeshifting.<br /> <br /> Elemental dragon-bodies, however, are the default state of the Dragon-Blooded. The Dragon-Blooded cannot transform into an elemental form because they were <i>born</i> with an elemental body and they spend their lives developing it through their charms and Essence (or rather, they learn charms and increase their Essence by developing their elemental bodies).<br /> <br /> If there is such a thing as an elemental shintai, it's Terrestrial Exaltation.</div> </div> </div> </div>See that's the thing, what part of Infernal Shintai, even as purposed in the preview, couldn't just be written as scene-long charms?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/726-amine-hsu","name":"Amine Hsu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar726_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T12:16:29-08:00","id":63536,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amine Hsu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai?p=63534#post63534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> See that's the thing, what part of Infernal Shintai, even as purposed in the preview, couldn't just be written as scene-long charms?</div> </div> </div> </div>The thematic part, where much like Form charms, they're supposed to represent emulating something &quot;External&quot; to you, and the mechanical part where, much like Form charms, they're exclusive.<br /> <br /> Generic scene-longs have neither that thematic connotation nor that mechanical imitation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/782-lafing-cat","name":"Lafing Cat","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"240"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T12:20:57-08:00","id":63539,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Lafing Cat</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai?p=63536#post63536\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The thematic part, where much like Form charms, they're supposed to represent emulating something &quot;External&quot; to you, and the mechanical part where, much like Form charms, they're exclusive.<br /> <br /> Generic scene-longs have neither that thematic connotation nor that mechanical imitation.</div> </div> </div> </div>Playing Devil's Advocate, both these could be pointed back at the idea of 'Elemental Shintai' with Dragonbloods having the obvious 'external' source of inspiraton in the Elemental Dragons to emulate.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/726-amine-hsu","name":"Amine Hsu","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar726_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"176"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T12:21:37-08:00","id":63540,"title":"","content":"Vance's tweets mention that Unassailable Body of [Element] is still in 3e, so I'm guessing DBs will retain some light transformative effects, but I wouldn't really want them to have a &quot;secret ultimate form&quot;. Aesthetically, the Dragon-Blooded equivalent to Deadly Beastman Technique is basically what you get automatically for having high Breeding and going full anima. Despite their elemental associations they're one of the more &quot;human&quot; types of Exalted, so I think it'd be a bit weird if it went farther than that.<br /> <br /> TCS is where you see the rawest expression of pure elemental themes, and I could see some of this stuff joining Invulnerable Body of Bronze in the TCS roster. Given what we've heard about different sorcerous initiations and splat-specific custom initiation charms, I have my hopes up that Terrestrial Exalted sorcerers will have some way to specialize in spells that reflect their Aspect, which would help make it more than a purely aesthetic choice.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/104-gayo","name":"Gayo","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar104_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1948"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T12:25:45-08:00","id":63544,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amine Hsu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai?p=63534#post63534\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> See that's the thing, what part of Infernal Shintai, even as purposed in the preview, couldn't just be written as scene-long charms?</div> </div> </div> </div>The fact that you can mix-and-match to make your own and the fact that it's abilities basically replace the ones of your regular charm set.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>I made some Martial Arts for 3e, look at them <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/723442-survival-is-fury-the-monster-reborn-ex3\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> and <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/761356-orgiastic-fugitive-style-3e\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/632-while-my-guitar","name":"While My Guitar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar632_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"606"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T12:26:27-08:00","id":63545,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Amine Hsu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai?p=63539#post63539\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Playing Devil's Advocate, both these could be pointed back at the idea of 'Elemental Shintai' with Dragonbloods having the obvious 'external' source of inspiraton in the Elemental Dragons to emulate.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's called Terrestrial Exaltation.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/75951-ex3-why-gods-need-the-exigence\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Why Gods Need the Exigence</a> - Plot hooks for Exigent characters of various gods.<br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/113648-ex3-homebrew-solar-charms\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] Homebrew Solar Charms</a> - I can see the future, and it is glorious.<br /> <a href=\"https://glasslibrary.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">[Ex3] The Glass Library</a> - My Exalted Third Edition Blog (Updated 24/04/2016)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/54-tiresias","name":"Tiresias","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar54_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2340"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T12:29:11-08:00","id":63548,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gayo</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/63320-dragon-blooded-and-elemental-shintai?p=63540#post63540\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Vance's tweets mention that Unassailable Body of [Element] is still in 3e, so I'm guessing DBs will retain some light transformative effects, but I wouldn't really want them to have a &quot;secret ultimate form&quot;. Aesthetically, the Dragon-Blooded equivalent to Deadly Beastman Technique is basically what you get automatically for having high Breeding and going full anima. Despite their elemental associations they're one of the more &quot;human&quot; types of Exalted, so I think it'd be a bit weird if it went farther than that.</div> </div> </div> </div>Everything I'm writing is just me writing stuff. It's up to the developers what will actually be in 3E!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Developer for Exalted<br /> <br /> Want to write for Exalted? Look at the <a href=\"http://theonyxpath.com/submission-guidelines/\" target=\"_blank\">freelancer submission guidelines.</a><br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/527-robert-vance","name":"Robert Vance","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar527_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10044"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-02T12:42:08-08:00","id":63553,"title":"","content":"I guess the big difference between Elemental Super Mode (or whatever you wanna call it) is that it's more subtle. Sure, your skin might be stone, and you can summon fire from your hands, but people still recognize you.<br /> <br /> Terrestrials go from this:<br /> <div style=\"margin: 5px 20px 5px 20px;\"> <div style=\"margin-bottom:2px; font-size: 80%;\"> <input type=\"button\" value=\"Spoiler\" style=\"width:45px;font-size:10px;margin:0px;padding:0px;\" onClick=\"if (this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display != '') { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = ''; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Hide'; } else { this.parentNode.parentNode.getElementsByTagName('div')[1].getElementsByTagName('div')[0].style.display = 'none'; this.innerText = ''; this.value = 'Show'; }\" /> </div> <div style=\" margin: 0px; padding: 6px; border: 3px groove blue; -webkit-border-radius: 10px; -moz-border-radius: 10px; border-radius: 10px; -webkit-box-shadow: 1px 1px 5px rgba(50, 50, 50